From: H713 HDMI capture workstream
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: h713: reserve a dedicated MIPS trace page on the bench

The source-2 trace changed a mailbox word in the apparently unused MIPS boot
code gap. Keep the next diagnostic mailbox in a separate 4 KiB page between
the documented decoder buffer and the temporary U-Boot logo. Reserve it
from Linux while the retained MIPS is running. This is an opt-in board-local
diagnostic reservation, not a production ABI.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h713-hy200-qz713df-a1.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h713-hy200-qz713df-a1.dts
@@ -9,4 +9,12 @@
 	chosen {
 		bootargs = "console=ttyS0,115200 console=tty0 earlycon root=/dev/mmcblk0p26 rootwait rootfstype=ext4 rw net.ifnames=0 panic=5 clk_ignore_unused pd_ignore_unused cma=128M";
 	};
+
+	reserved-memory {
+		/* After decoder@4d941000; below U-Boot's 0x4e000000 logo. */
+		hdmi_trace_reserved: hdmi-trace@4d980000 {
+			reg = <0x4d980000 0x1000>;
+			no-map;
+		};
+	};
 };
